id_rsa*
secrets.json

# Hardhat & Smart Contract Artifacts & Cache
artifacts/
*/artifacts/
cache/
*/cache/
typechain/
typechain-types/

# Production Builds & Bundler outputs
dist/
*/dist/
build/
*/build/
out/
